Error [jet.ClosedSetElse]: This `else` stands for cases of the closed set `OS`
  --> tests/ui/closed_else_os_dispatch.jet:10:9
    |
 10 |         else -> print("other")
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `OS` is a closed set: an `else` would take any case added to `OS` later silently, instead of the compiler asking you to handle it
 Fix: Name the cases instead: `.Windows | .Web | .Wasm | .Freestanding ->`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0641

Error [jet.ClosedSetElse]: This `else` can never run; every case of `OS` is already handled
