    |
 20 |         else -> print("unreachable")
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `OS` is a closed set: an `else` would take any case added to `OS` later silently, instead of the compiler asking you to handle it
 Fix: Delete the `else` arm
